nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xM2JRsInHk0Q7kNvwGuMg7G&_nc_oc=AdpgIV-gFrLoApvRXdUBJw5Uu3tRs1cc4yR0pLbg9rWN0OmMJbJ1npJcvmCFqRNbboE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3fNaAOkrgK1CS6wG29U7u3mlbHujkgeUQ9en2m5uxQgw&oe=69D24D64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "879363444937419", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_879363448270752_400143134733280957_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ArPsg73nK0oQ7kNvwH6Grsh&_nc_oc=AdqjYUnlafiQScFeoXFSk4fsvuOsGbO3zUkEV0T4yUh9wGy3IhPpNg7X4A40er3lPPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2wOsspiPkkQppKhHEqnOV_jhW6I8FJN8SWTyU2Thy0Zg&oe=69D26934"}, "display_name": "Ape Skate Shootout", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "ape", "skate", "hangout"], "long_description": "Shoot. Skate. Toot. \n\nCome hang out at the Skate Park, where you can slide down half pipes and pull off sweet tricks while hanging out with your friends - and grab a gun to mow them down. \n\nIn Ape Skate Shootout you can : \n- Complete skateboard tricks and stunts to earn SkateCash, used to upgrade your character or the Skate Park itself\n- Charge your farts observing your gas meter, and use them to boost around the Skate Park (or to disrespect your fallen foes). \n- Find a variety of weapons to mow down other players and compete in tense deathmatches\n- Combine wacky gadgets and upgrade combos to become the sickest Ape on the half-pipe. \n- Private and public lobby codes to join friends easier\n\nFeaturing a unique locomotion system that's easy to learn and difficult to master, and simple gunplay mechanics with a varied upgrade system, every match of Ape Skate Shootout will feel completely different. ", "short_description": "Kick Ass and Pass Gas - Shoot, skate and toot your way around the Skate Park pulling off tricks and eliminating your opponents. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_